        "description": "Mutating webhook selector does not match any namespace. The webhook is configured but never fires — pods launch without the expected mutation.",
        "action": "Verify the namespaceSelector labels on the MutatingWebhookConfiguration match at least one namespace. Common causes: label key typo (inject vs istio-injection), namespace created without the required label, Helm upgrade that narrowed the selector without updating namespaces. Add the expected label to target namespaces or widen the webhook selector.",
        "example": "{\n  \"k8s\": {\n    \"webhook\": {\n      \"kind\": \"MutatingWebhookConfiguration\",\n      \"selector_matches_any_namespace\": true\n    }\n  }\n}\n"
