      "defect": "MutatingWebhookConfiguration selector matches no namespace.\n",
      "infection": "The webhook is deployed and the configuration exists, but the namespaceSelector labels don't match any namespace in the cluster. The webhook never intercepts pod admission. Sidecar injection doesn't happen. Config injection doesn't happen. The webhook appears healthy in API server logs because it's never called — not because it's working.\n",
